OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister promises to look at
OL,4,AWelsh council powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government is to examine the
OL,7,Fpowers councils have and how
OL,8,Fauthorities work together regionally,
OL,9,Fthe first minister has announced.
OL,11,FAt a speech at Cardiff University, Rhun
OL,12,Fap Iorwerth announced that this could
OL,13,Flead to new legislation after the next
OL,14,Felection in 2030.
OL,16,FHe is due to meet Prime Minister Andy
OL,17,FBurnham, who says ministers in Cardiff
OL,18,Fshould hand more powers to local
OL,19,Fauthorities, later this month.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
