OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister promises to look at
OL,4,AWelsh council powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAp Iorwerth denied offering a quid pro
OL,7,Fquo to the prime minister, who the
OL,8,FPlaid Cymru leader is hoping will give
OL,9,Fthe Cardiff government more powers and
OL,10,Ffunding.
